OL,3,GNEWSAResidents evacuated after arson
OL,4,Aattack at former gym
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents were forced to evacuate their
OL,7,Fhomes after an arson attack at a
OL,8,Fderelict building in Londonderry.
OL,10,FThe fire started at about 06:00 BST on
OL,11,FSaturday at the former gym on Grainan
OL,12,FDrive.
OL,14,FPolice said no one was in the building
OL,15,Fat the time and no injuries were
OL,16,Freported but residents from the
OL,17,Fadjoining property were evacuated as a
OL,18,Fsafety precaution.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
