OL,3,GNEWSAResidents evacuated after arson
OL,4,Aattack at former gym
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne resident said they awoke to
OL,7,F"banging on the door" but after two
OL,8,Fhours they were able to return to their
OL,9,Fhomes once the fire was brought under
OL,10,Fcontrol.
